  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1074602/description_670c44a4-aa1a-411f-bbfc-4a5fec532b04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"247\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">¡ 仍在開發中 !</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🪑&nbsp;關於 🪑</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Furniture Beetle 是一個專注於為原版遊戲添加內容的模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過家具體驗全新的 Vanilla+ 玩法。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GZiVFXv.png\" alt=\"barra2\" width=\"2063\" height=\"51\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔧 未來更新 🔧</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">讓烤箱能夠正常運作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂圖形使用者介面</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具的顏色變化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多原版風格的家具</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎提供反饋和建議 😊</span></p>",
